---@class posthog.pulse.BriefSettings
---@field min_abs_change_pct? number Minimum absolute percent change for a movement to count as significant. Default 20.
---@field min_baseline_value? number Minimum per-sample baseline volume before a movement is considered. Default 10.
---@field max_anchor_insights? number Maximum anchor insights gathered per brief. Default 10.
---@field fallback_dashboard_count? number How many recent dashboards to pull insights from when no anchors are set. Default 3.
---@field confidence_threshold? number Minimum confidence for a section or opportunity to survive the gate. Default 0.6.
---@field max_opportunities? number Maximum opportunities kept per brief. Default 3.
---@field max_annotations? number Maximum annotations gathered as context per brief. Default 20.

